            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Thu Nguyen",
                        "email": "thu@os.amperecomputing.com",
                        "username": "ThuBaNguyen"
                    },
                    "message": "```\nbios_string_attribute.cpp:166:    auto entry = reinterpret_cast<pldm_bios_attr_val_table_entry*>(\npdr_state_sensor.hpp:145:                bitfield8_t* bf = reinterpret_cast<bitfield8_t*>(start + index);\nbios_config.cpp:1106:        auto entry = reinterpret_cast<pldm_bios_attr_val_table_entry*>(\nbios_enum_attribute.cpp:275:    auto entry = reinterpret_cast<pldm_bios_attr_val_table_entry*>(\nplatform_numeric_effecter.hpp:193:        uint8_t currentValue = *(reinterpret_cast<uint8_t*>(&effecterValue[0]));\nplatform_numeric_effecter.hpp:198:        int8_t currentValue = *(reinterpret_cast<int8_t*>(&effecterValue[0]));\nplatform_numeric_effecter.hpp:204:            *(reinterpret_cast<uint16_t*>(&effecterValue[0]));\nplatform_numeric_effecter.hpp:209:        int16_t currentValue = *(reinterpret_cast<int16_t*>(&effecterValue[0]));\nplatform_numeric_effecter.hpp:215:            *(reinterpret_cast<uint32_t*>(&effecterValue[0]));\nplatform_numeric_effecter.hpp:220:        int32_t currentValue = *(reinterpret_cast<int32_t*>(&effecterValue[0]));\nplatform.cpp:752:    auto locatorValue = reinterpret_cast<pldm_terminus_locator_type_mctp_eid*>(\npdr_state_effecter.hpp:133:                bitfield8_t* bf = reinterpret_cast<bitfield8_t*>(start + index);\nbios_integer_attribute.cpp:229:    auto entry = reinterpret_cast<pldm_bios_attr_val_table_entry*>(\n\n```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Pavithra Barithaya",
                        "email": "pavithrabarithaya07@gmail.com",
                        "username": "Pavithrab7"
                    },
                    "message": "for the scenarios in `platform_numeric_effecter.hpp` file - \nwe cannot directly use placement new in this scenario in the same way as reinterpret_cast because of the following reasons:\n\nPlacement new is used to construct an object at a specific memory location. It requires a pointer to pre-allocated memory, and then it constructs the object there. Placement new calls the constructor of the object.\n\nWe are simply interpreting the existing data in effecterValue as a uint8_t and retrieving its value, so there's no object to construct here. We are not trying to initialize an object; we are just reading a value from memory. Placement new wouldn't apply here because we are not constructing a new object but accessing an existing byte."
                }
            ],
